\n\
Wait, opponent's creatures are tapped — they attacked me. I'm at 16, down from 20, so I took 4? Inspector 1 + June 2 = 3... plus maybe something. Actually maybe they attacked turn 2 with Inspector (1) and turn 3 with both (3) = 4 total. That works.\n\
\n\
