      "thinking": "Let me assess the situation. I'm at 15 life, opponent at 18. My board: Avatar Enthusiasts 4/4, Earth King's Lieutenant 1/1 (sick). Lands: Forest (tapped), Island, Plains (tapped), Plains. So I have 2 untapped lands: Island and Plains = {U}{W} effectively... wait, Island gives U, Plains gives W. So I have 2 mana available: one blue, one white.\n\
\n\
