      "reasoning": "Momo's death trigger is on the stack. My choice: a +1/+1 counter on Earth King's Lieutenant makes it a 3/3 trampler — real pressure against an opponent at 12 (who's also draining themselves with Obsessive Pursuit). Scry 2 is tempting to dig for land #5, but the guaranteed board pressure matters more since I have playable 4-drops (Hakoda, Waterbender) already in hand.",
      "thinking": "Let me analyze the current situation:\n\
\n\
- I'm at 14hp, opponent at 12hp\n\
- My board: Earth King's Lieutenant 2/2 (sick), Forest (tapped), Island, Plains (tapped), Plains (tapped)\n\
- My hand: Earth Kingdom Soldier (5 mana), Flexible Waterbender (4 mana), Hakoda (4 mana), The Spirit Oasis (3 mana)\n\
- Momo just died blocking the 4/4 Forest. Momo's trigger is on the stack.\n\
\n\
Momo's trigger options:\n\
1. Create a Food token\n\
2. Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control\n\
3. Scry 2\n\
\n\
The +1/+1 counter on Earth King's Lieutenant would make it a 3/3 with trample. That's decent. Scry 2 helps me find lands or gas. Food token is weak.\n\
\n\
I have a hand full of plays: Earth Kingdom Soldier (5), Flexible Waterbender (4), Hakoda (4). I have 5 lands total next turn (Forest, Island, Plains, Plains + I need to play a land or have 5... wait, I have 4 lands, so next turn I'll have 4 mana unless I draw a land. The Spirit Oasis is a land? No, wait — The Spirit Oasis costs {2}{U}, it's not a land, it's a Shrine artifact or something. Let me check the oracle text.\n\
\n\
The Spirit Oasis {2}{U}: When this enters, draw a card for each Shrine you control. / Whenever another Shrine you control enters, draw a card.\n\
\n\
So it's a 3-mana artifact (Shrine) that draws a card for each Shrine I control (including itself? \"for each Shrine you control\" when it enters — it includes itself typically). It draws at least 1 card.\n\
\n\
My decision: counter on EKL vs Scry 2.\n\
\n\
EKL at 3/3 trample attacks into opponent's board: Callous Inspector 1/1, June 2/2, and a 4/4 Forest land (untapped next turn). Opponent is at 12. If EKL connects twice, that's good pressure. The counter is permanent value. Scry 2 helps dig for lands since I have 5-mana plays and only 4 lands.\n\
\n\
