      "chosen_args": {
        "summary": "Opponent exiled my Avatar Enthusiasts with Sold Out, then attacked with Callous Inspector (1/1 menace) and the 4/4 earthbent Forest. Blocking the Forest with Momo to save 4 damage; Momo's death trigger will give me a counter or scry. I take 1 from Inspector, going to 14.",
